WEBVTT

00:02.325 --> 00:05.325
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:05.325 --> 00:12.258
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:14.625 --> 00:16.725
- [creepy giggling]
- [令人毛骨悚然的咯咯笑]

00:16.725 --> 00:18.291
- Hmm.
- 唔。

00:18.291 --> 00:21.825
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

00:21.825 --> 00:25.091
- SpongeBob! Where are those
patties?
- 海绵宝宝！那些在哪里
肉饼？

00:25.091 --> 00:28.825
- Coming right...down,
Squidward.
- 向右...向下，
章鱼哥。

00:28.825 --> 00:30.858
- What are you talking about,
SpongeBob?
- 你在说什么，
海绵宝宝？

00:30.858 --> 00:32.225
Don't you mean
coming right up?
你不是说
马上就来吗？

00:32.225 --> 00:34.691
- Mmm...
- I don't see what you're--
- 嗯...
-我不明白你是什么--

00:36.458 --> 00:37.691
[sizzling]
Aah!
[嘶嘶声]
啊啊！

00:37.691 --> 00:40.658
- Nice catch, Squidward!
- 钓得好，章鱼哥！

00:40.658 --> 00:41.891
- Thanks...
- 谢谢...

00:41.891 --> 00:44.725
[child crying]
[孩子的哭声]

00:44.725 --> 00:45.991
- Whoo!
- 呼！

00:45.991 --> 00:47.658
[chortling, gibbering]
[咯咯笑，胡言乱语]

00:47.658 --> 00:49.925
- I want my teddy fish!
- 我想要我的泰迪鱼！

00:49.925 --> 00:51.425
Waaaaah!
- Ha ha, all right,
哇啊啊！
- 哈哈，好吧，

00:51.425 --> 00:54.825
don't worry, little boy,
we'll find it!
别担心，小男孩，
我们会找到它的！

00:54.825 --> 00:56.458
This kid lost his toy.
这孩子丢了他的玩具。

00:56.458 --> 00:58.358
SpongeBob, I need you to check
the Lost and Found.
海绵宝宝，我需要你检查一下
失物招领处。

00:58.358 --> 01:01.891
- Ooh! I didn't know
we had a Lost and Found.
- 哦！我不知道
我们有失物招领处。

01:01.891 --> 01:03.891
- I love my teddy fish!
- 我喜欢我的泰迪鱼！

01:03.891 --> 01:05.891
[wailing]
[哀号]

01:08.025 --> 01:10.325
- You better find it quick,
SpongeBob.
- 你最好快点找到它，
海绵宝宝。

01:10.325 --> 01:12.958
Kid's bawlin' is chasing
me customers away.
孩子的哭声正在追逐
我的顾客走了。

01:12.958 --> 01:14.358
Follow me, boy-o!
跟我来，小伙子！

01:14.358 --> 01:15.891
- Waaaaaaah!
- 哇啊啊啊！

01:16.825 --> 01:19.725
[both coughing]
[两人都咳嗽]

01:19.725 --> 01:21.391
- Is there a ladder?
- 有梯子吗？

01:21.391 --> 01:22.958
- Yes.
- 是的。

01:22.958 --> 01:25.458
- Aaaaahhh!
- 啊啊啊！

01:25.458 --> 01:27.158
Aaaaah!
[whomp]
啊啊啊！
[重击]

01:27.158 --> 01:29.158
- Here's the ladder, boy-o!
- Okay, I--
- 这是梯子，小伙子！
- 好吧，我--

01:29.158 --> 01:30.291
[whack]
[重击]

01:30.291 --> 01:31.425
Nice catch!
不错的收获！

01:31.425 --> 01:33.325
- [groaning, grunting]
- [呻吟，咕哝]

01:34.558 --> 01:36.025
[wham]
Ow!
[重击]
噢！

01:36.025 --> 01:38.625
- Now, try not to get bit
by anything poisonous!
- 现在，尽量不要被咬
任何有毒的东西！

01:38.625 --> 01:40.491
- What?
- Oh, nothing, nothing.
- 什么？
- 哦，没什么，没什么。

01:40.491 --> 01:42.325
Good luck!
祝你好运！

01:42.325 --> 01:44.525
- Oh, this must be
the Lost and Found!
- 哦，这一定是
失物招领处！

01:46.091 --> 01:47.591
It's not in here!
它不在这里！

01:47.591 --> 01:49.991
- Try turning on the lights!
- 尝试打开灯！

01:49.991 --> 01:51.691
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

01:51.691 --> 01:53.158
[click]
[点击]

01:53.158 --> 01:56.125
- [gasps]
Oh! Whoa!
- [喘气]
哦！哇！

01:56.125 --> 01:58.858
Whoa!
哇！

01:58.858 --> 02:01.225
Wow! Lost umbrellas!
哇！雨伞丢了！

02:01.225 --> 02:02.825
Lost flip flops!
人字拖丢了！

02:02.825 --> 02:05.091
Lost keys! Lost remotes!
钥匙丢了！遥控器丢了！

02:05.091 --> 02:09.825
Oh! A whole, entire shelf of
lost "cool guy" shades!
哦！整整一整个架子
失去了“酷哥”色调！

02:09.825 --> 02:12.425
Now, that's a sight
for more eyes.
现在，这是一个景象
为了更多的眼睛。

02:12.425 --> 02:13.958
[laughs]
[笑]

02:16.458 --> 02:18.191
Oh, no pictures, please.
噢，没有照片，拜托。

02:18.191 --> 02:21.625
Did you get my good side?
[laughs]
你得到我的好处了吗？
[笑]

02:21.625 --> 02:23.525
[giggle echoes]
[咯咯回声]

02:23.525 --> 02:26.058
[clattering]
[咔哒声]

02:26.058 --> 02:28.225
What a funny echo.
多么有趣的回声啊。

02:28.225 --> 02:29.025
Ha...ha.
哈哈。

02:29.025 --> 02:32.825
[giggle echoes]
[咯咯回声]

02:32.825 --> 02:34.825
[gulps]
Hey!
[吞咽]
嘿！

02:34.825 --> 02:37.458
[laughs]
There's bric-a-brac
[笑]
有小摆设

02:37.458 --> 02:38.725
and gee-gaws!
哎呀！

02:38.725 --> 02:42.358
[gasps] I wonder
if there's tchotchkes!
[喘气]我想知道
如果有小玩意的话！

02:42.358 --> 02:43.558
Oh! Oh!
哦！哦！

02:43.558 --> 02:45.691
Tchotchkes!
小摆设！

02:45.691 --> 02:47.591
Lost novelty items!
新奇物品丢失！

02:47.591 --> 02:49.858
Wow!
哇！

02:49.858 --> 02:52.325
I love lost novelty items!
我喜欢丢失的新奇物品！

02:52.325 --> 02:53.858
Ooh!
哦！

02:53.858 --> 02:55.225
[teeth clicking]
Uh-uh-eh-eh-uh--
[牙齿咔嚓]
呃呃呃呃呃呃——

02:55.225 --> 02:57.391
[whoopee cushions farting]
Excuse me!
[呼呼垫放屁]
对不起！

02:57.391 --> 02:59.558
Oh!
哦！

02:59.558 --> 03:00.958
Ah!
啊!

03:00.958 --> 03:04.825
[cushions fart
in rhythm to Latin music]
[坐垫放屁
以拉丁音乐的节奏]

03:04.825 --> 03:07.025
[fart-fart-fart-fart]
*
[放屁放屁放屁]
*

03:07.025 --> 03:09.091
[fart-fart-fart-fart-fart]
*
[放屁放屁放屁放屁]
*

03:09.091 --> 03:10.825
[fart-fart-fart]
*
[放屁放屁]
*

03:10.825 --> 03:12.825
Whaa!
哇！

03:12.825 --> 03:13.958
Aah!
啊啊！

03:13.958 --> 03:15.958
[clucking]
[咯咯笑]

03:15.958 --> 03:17.991
[fart fart-fart-fart fart!]
【放屁放屁放屁！】

03:17.991 --> 03:20.258
[fart fart]
[放屁放屁]

03:22.091 --> 03:25.591
Oh, thank you,
cymbal-clapping sea chimps!
哦，谢谢你，
敲铙钹的海黑猩猩！

03:25.591 --> 03:26.958
What is this?
这是什么？

03:26.958 --> 03:28.625
Looks like Bikini Bottom.
看起来像比基尼泳裤。

03:30.058 --> 03:31.058
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

03:31.058 --> 03:35.058
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

03:35.058 --> 03:36.925
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

03:36.925 --> 03:39.825
Yee! Eee-eee-eee!
呀！诶诶诶！

03:39.825 --> 03:41.125
Whew!
哇！

03:41.125 --> 03:42.491
[wham]
Whoa!
[重击]
哇！

03:42.491 --> 03:44.125
[distant chuckle]
[远处的笑声]

03:44.125 --> 03:46.825
- Hey, Mr. Krabs,
you know that annoying
- 嘿，蟹老板先生，
你知道那很烦人

03:46.825 --> 03:49.091
crying kid?
[crying in background]
爱哭的孩子？
[背景中哭泣]

03:49.091 --> 03:51.558
He's still crying...
and it's still annoying!
他还在哭……
而且还是很烦人！

03:51.558 --> 03:53.825
- Squidward,
I'm glad you're here.
- 章鱼哥，
我很高兴你在这里。

03:53.825 --> 03:57.091
I think SpongeBob may be lost
in the Lost and Found.
我认为海绵宝宝可能会迷失
在失物招领处。

03:57.091 --> 04:00.125
- And this concerns me how,
exactly?
- 这让我担心，
到底是？

04:00.125 --> 04:01.458
Wait--what?!
等等——什么？！

04:01.458 --> 04:02.825
Aaaaahhhhhh!
- Don't worry.
啊啊啊啊！
- 不用担心。

04:02.825 --> 04:04.025
There's a ladder.
有一个梯子。

04:04.025 --> 04:05.025
[crying continues]
[哭泣继续]

04:05.025 --> 04:08.291
all: [angry muttering]
全体：[愤怒的嘀咕]

04:08.291 --> 04:10.925
- And find that toy...
- 找到那个玩具...

04:10.925 --> 04:12.125
pronto!
很快！

04:14.458 --> 04:15.991
- [muttering]
- [嘀咕]

04:17.491 --> 04:20.725
Whoa! Are you the people
of the too-small clothes?
哇！你是人民吗
衣服太小了？

04:20.725 --> 04:24.591
- No. We were children,
lost in the Krusty Krab
- 不，我们还是孩子，
迷失在蟹堡王中

04:24.591 --> 04:26.858
over 60 years ago,
60多年前，

04:26.858 --> 04:28.525
and we were never claimed.
我们从未被认领。

04:28.525 --> 04:30.091
- Did you drop a box
on my head?
- 你掉了一个盒子吗
在我头上？

04:30.091 --> 04:32.725
- Of course!
It's how we say hello.
- 当然！
这就是我们打招呼的方式。

04:32.725 --> 04:34.025
- Oh!
- 哦！

04:34.025 --> 04:35.825
Hello!
- [weakly] Hello.
你好！
- [弱弱地] 你好。

04:35.825 --> 04:37.325
[moaning]
[呻吟]

04:37.325 --> 04:39.691
- Oh, no...looks like
I'm lost now too.
- 哦，不……看起来像
我现在也迷路了。

04:39.691 --> 04:43.258
- Don't worry. You are found
and can live with us now.
- 不用担心。你被发现了
现在可以和我们住在一起了。

04:43.258 --> 04:46.291
- How did you survive
down here all this time?
- 你是怎么活下来的
一直在这里？

04:46.291 --> 04:48.658
- People leave
all kinds of things behind.
- 人们离开
各种事情都在后面。

04:48.658 --> 04:50.391
Like gum. And mints.
就像口香糖一样。还有薄荷糖。

04:50.391 --> 04:52.725
They leave lots of mints.
他们留下很多薄荷糖。

04:57.991 --> 04:59.625
- Your breath
is delightfully fresh.
- 你的呼吸
新鲜得令人愉快。

04:59.625 --> 05:02.525
- [claps twice]
Bring on the welcoming feast!
- [鼓掌两次]
来一场迎新盛宴吧！

05:04.125 --> 05:06.958
all: Welcoming feast!
全体：欢迎盛宴！

05:06.958 --> 05:08.658
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

05:08.658 --> 05:09.825
[ding]
[叮]

05:09.825 --> 05:11.258
- Dig in!
- 挖进去！

05:17.058 --> 05:19.325
- [crunching, cracking]
Ooh...
- [嘎吱作响，破裂]
哦...

05:23.325 --> 05:26.358
- Hey, little dolly.
You must be getting hungry!
- 嘿，小娃娃。
你一定饿了！

05:26.358 --> 05:27.525
[doll squeaks]
- Oh, hey!
[娃娃吱吱声]
- 哦，嘿！

05:27.525 --> 05:28.891
That's the teddy fish!
这就是泰迪鱼！

05:28.891 --> 05:30.825
My boss, Mr. Krabs,
told me to grab that.
我的老板蟹老板先生
告诉我抓住那个。

05:30.825 --> 05:32.525
Thank you!
- Grr! This?
谢谢你！
- 呃！这？

05:32.525 --> 05:35.358
I found it, so...
finders keepers!
我找到了，所以...
发现者、守护者！

05:35.358 --> 05:40.091
- Finders keepers.
Finders keepers.
- 发现者和守门员。
发现者守门员。

05:40.958 --> 05:42.325
- Huh?
- Yoink!
- 啊？
- 哟克！

05:42.325 --> 05:44.825
Losers weepers!
失败者哭泣！

05:44.825 --> 05:47.358
- He is using our sacred words
against us!
- 他正在使用我们神圣的话语
反对我们！

05:47.358 --> 05:50.725
- That's my teddy fish!
Get him!
- 那是我的泰迪鱼！
抓住他！

05:50.725 --> 05:54.491
- Sorry, but this has to go back
to its rightful owner!
- 抱歉，但这必须回去
归其合法拥有者！

05:56.125 --> 05:58.991
[all gasping,
wheezing, coughing]
[全都气喘吁吁，
气喘、咳嗽]

05:58.991 --> 06:01.391
- Run...like the wind...
- 奔跑吧……像风一样……

06:03.458 --> 06:06.825
- Moron!
I mean, SpongeBoooob?!
- 白痴！
我的意思是，海绵布布？！

06:06.825 --> 06:10.725
I can't believe Old Man Krabs
has held on to all this stuff.
我不敢相信蟹老翁
一直坚持所有这些东西。

06:10.725 --> 06:13.291
Oooh! Kazoos!
噢！卡祖笛！

06:13.291 --> 06:17.125
Why, I had a kazoo
when I was a child...
为什么，我有一支卡祖笛
当我还是个孩子的时候...

06:17.125 --> 06:20.058
Everybody loved it!
每个人都喜欢它！

06:20.058 --> 06:22.825
[playing off-key notes]
[演奏走调音符]

06:22.825 --> 06:25.058
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

06:25.058 --> 06:27.225
- Oh! Ow! My ears!
- 哦！噢！我的耳朵！

06:27.225 --> 06:28.825
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

06:31.425 --> 06:33.158
- These are clarinets!!
- 这些是单簧管！

06:33.158 --> 06:35.625
In fact, these are
all my clarinets!
其实这些都是
我所有的单簧管！

06:35.625 --> 06:38.091
Wait a minute--
these weren't lost!
等一下——
这些并没有丢失！

06:38.091 --> 06:40.658
They were all in my locker!
它们都在我的储物柜里！

06:40.658 --> 06:42.091
Mmm...
[panting gets louder]
嗯...
[喘气声变大]

06:42.091 --> 06:43.458
Now what could that possibly--
现在这可能是什么——

06:43.458 --> 06:44.258
Uhhh!
呃！

06:44.258 --> 06:46.358
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

06:46.358 --> 06:48.658
[clarinets cracking]
[单簧管爆裂声]

06:48.658 --> 06:49.958
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:49.958 --> 06:52.125
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:52.125 --> 06:53.925
Typical.
典型的。

06:53.925 --> 06:58.858
- Squidward? SpongeBob?
- 章鱼哥？海绵宝宝？

06:58.858 --> 07:01.825
It's the curse
of the Lost and Found:
这是诅咒
失物招领处：

07:01.825 --> 07:04.191
no one ever gets found.
没有人被发现。

07:04.191 --> 07:06.725
They just stay lost.
他们只是迷路了。

07:09.425 --> 07:10.725
Oh, well, back to work.
哦，好吧，回去工作吧。

07:10.725 --> 07:12.991
- Waaaah!
- The ambiance in this place
- 哇啊啊！
- 这个地方的氛围

07:12.991 --> 07:15.291
stinks!
很臭！

07:15.291 --> 07:17.458
- [gasps] Stinky ambiance?
- [喘气] 气氛很臭？

07:17.458 --> 07:21.125
Oooh, it's a dark time
for the Krusty Krab.
噢，这是一个黑暗的时刻
为蟹堡王。

07:21.125 --> 07:22.825
- Waaaaah!
- 哇啊啊！

07:22.825 --> 07:25.358
- Waaaaaah!
- 哇啊啊啊！

07:27.725 --> 07:29.291
- Oh! Lost toys!
- 哦！玩具丢了！

07:29.291 --> 07:31.958
Aah!
[panting]
啊啊！
[气喘吁吁]

07:31.958 --> 07:35.458
[all wheezing]
- Get him!
[全都气喘吁吁]
- 抓住他！

07:35.458 --> 07:36.825
[thud]
- Uhh!
[砰]
- 呃！

07:40.625 --> 07:41.625
[clinking]
[叮叮当当]

07:41.625 --> 07:43.625
- Whoa--oh!
- 哇 - 哦！

07:43.625 --> 07:44.858
[boom]
[繁荣]

07:46.058 --> 07:47.725
Lost Toilets?
厕所丢了？

07:50.991 --> 07:52.425
- We need more speed!
- 我们需要更快的速度！

07:52.425 --> 07:54.458
[flushes, water rushes]
[冲水，水流]

07:56.258 --> 07:57.925
- [mutters]
- [嘀咕]

07:57.925 --> 07:59.925
- Aah!
- Ohh!
- 啊啊！
- 哦！

07:59.925 --> 08:01.058
- Wha-ooh...
- 哇哦...

08:01.058 --> 08:02.158
[boom]
[繁荣]

08:02.158 --> 08:04.158
- Lost Pets!
- 丢失的宠物！

08:04.158 --> 08:06.325
[gasps, whimpers]
[喘息，呜咽]

08:06.325 --> 08:08.725
- Hyah! Hyah!
- 哈！哈！

08:08.725 --> 08:10.191
Mush! Mush!
糊涂！糊涂！

08:10.191 --> 08:13.491
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

08:13.491 --> 08:14.825
[all whistling cheerfully]
[大家欢快地吹着口哨]

08:14.825 --> 08:18.158
- Lost Mine!
- 我的丢失了！

08:18.158 --> 08:19.425
[thud]
Whaa--
[砰]
哇——

08:19.425 --> 08:21.225
[deep inhale]
[blows]
[深吸气]
[打击]

08:21.225 --> 08:23.125
[old kids groaning]
[老孩子的呻吟声]

08:23.125 --> 08:25.258
- Lost world!
- 失落的世界！

08:25.258 --> 08:27.825
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

08:30.591 --> 08:33.925
- A hatch! Maybe
that's the emergency exit!
- 舱门！也许
那是紧急出口！

08:36.991 --> 08:38.491
Grease trap!?
隔油池！？

08:40.825 --> 08:44.391
[Squidward screaming]
[章鱼哥尖叫]

08:44.391 --> 08:46.058
- [panicked breathing,
whimpering]
- [惊慌的呼吸，
呜咽]

08:46.058 --> 08:48.891
[suspenseful music]
[悬疑音乐]

08:48.891 --> 08:50.258
Lost dead ends?!
迷失了死胡同？！

08:50.258 --> 08:52.225
[whimpering, muttering]
[呜咽，低语]

08:53.891 --> 08:55.991
- Give us the teddy fish!
- 把泰迪鱼给我们！

08:55.991 --> 08:59.025
- Teddy fish!
Teddy fish!
- 泰迪鱼！
泰迪鱼！

08:59.025 --> 09:03.191
- No! This teddy fish belongs
to a poor, sweet child!
- 不！这条泰迪鱼属于
给一个可怜的、可爱的孩子！

09:03.191 --> 09:05.425
Huh?
啊？

09:05.425 --> 09:07.025
Patty grease?
帕蒂油脂？

09:07.025 --> 09:10.058
Oh, no! I haven't cleaned
the grease trap in years!
哦，不！我还没清理过
多年来的油脂捕集器！

09:10.058 --> 09:11.625
both: Oh, no.
- Quick!
两人：哦，不。
- 快的！

09:11.625 --> 09:13.758
Get on each other's
shoulders.
搭上彼此的
肩膀。

09:15.425 --> 09:17.191
At least some of us
will survive.
至少我们中的一些人
会生存下来。

09:17.191 --> 09:20.058
- Aw, come on!
- 噢，来吧！

09:20.058 --> 09:21.858
- Wait!
I have a better idea!
- 等待！
我有一个更好的主意！

09:21.858 --> 09:23.325
[sharp whistle]
[尖锐的口哨声]

09:23.325 --> 09:27.625
[both wailing]
[双双哀嚎]

09:27.625 --> 09:30.391
- No SpongeBob,
no teddy fish,
- 没有海绵宝宝，
没有泰迪鱼，

09:30.391 --> 09:32.291
no customers!
没有顾客！

09:32.291 --> 09:34.191
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:34.191 --> 09:36.591
All is lost!
一切都失去了！

09:36.591 --> 09:38.158
[pounding on trap door]
[敲击活板门]

09:38.158 --> 09:39.425
[sniffles]
Who is it?
[抽鼻子]
是谁？

09:39.425 --> 09:41.291
- Tylo!
- Tylo who?
- 泰洛！
- 泰洛是谁？

09:41.291 --> 09:43.458
- [gasps]
- Tylosaurus!
- [喘气]
- 霸王龙！

09:43.458 --> 09:47.158
- SpongeBob!
Thank Neptune you're back, son!
- 海绵宝宝！
感谢海王星，你回来了，儿子！

09:47.158 --> 09:48.825
- Oh, good to be back
Mr. Krabs,
- 哦，很高兴回来
蟹老板先生，

09:48.825 --> 09:51.591
but I'm not the only one.
Look who I found!
但我不是唯一一个。
看看我找到谁了！

09:52.625 --> 09:54.858
- Ack! Get back! Get back!
- 嗯！回来吧！回来吧！

09:54.858 --> 09:57.258
- Ginger? Is that you?
- 姜？那是你吗？

09:57.258 --> 09:59.958
- Mom!
What are you doing here?
- 妈妈！
你在这里做什么？

09:59.958 --> 10:02.825
- We come here every week.
- 我们每周都来这里。

10:02.825 --> 10:03.725
- "We"?
- “我们”？

10:03.725 --> 10:06.625
- Yes.
Myself and your father
- 是的。
我和你父亲

10:06.625 --> 10:10.425
and the other parents
of kids who were lost here.
和其他父母
在这里失踪的孩子们。

10:10.425 --> 10:12.491
Where were you?
当时你在哪里？

10:12.491 --> 10:14.825
- In the Lost and Found!
- 在失物招领处！

10:14.825 --> 10:17.825
- [stutters]
There's a Lost and Found?
- [结结巴巴]
有失物招领处吗？

10:17.825 --> 10:20.891
- Hm. Maybe I should
put up a sign.
- 嗯。也许我应该
竖起一个标志。

10:20.891 --> 10:22.625
[all muttering]
- Aww, all the old people
[大家嘀咕]
- 哇，所有的老人

10:22.625 --> 10:26.191
are hugging.
all: Uhh...ow...ow!
正在拥抱。
全体：呃……呜……呜！

10:26.191 --> 10:28.225
- Dry your tears, little kid.
- 擦干你的眼泪，小孩子。

10:28.225 --> 10:30.691
Look! It's teddy fish!
看！这是泰迪鱼！

10:30.691 --> 10:33.558
- I don't want that anymore!
- 我不想再这样了！

10:33.558 --> 10:36.058
- Huh?
Mmm.
- 啊？
嗯。

10:36.058 --> 10:38.691
- I want this! Whaaa-hooo!
- 我想要这个！哇啊呼！

10:38.691 --> 10:40.858
- Well, I guess
we all learned a lesson
- 嗯，我想
我们都吸取了教训

10:40.858 --> 10:44.225
about being lost
and being found today.
关于迷失
并于今日被发现。

10:44.225 --> 10:45.725
- What's that,
Mr. Krabs?
- 那是什么，
蟹老板？

10:45.725 --> 10:47.425
- I don't know.
- Hey, speaking of lost,
- 我不知道。
- 嘿，说到迷失，

10:47.425 --> 10:48.658
where's Squidward?
章鱼哥在哪里？

10:48.658 --> 10:50.825
- Ahhhhhhh!
[blows off-key note]
- 啊啊啊啊！
[吹走调的音符]

10:50.825 --> 10:53.225
Aaaaahhhhhhhhhh!
啊啊啊啊啊啊！

10:53.225 --> 10:56.491
[ominous music]
[不祥的音乐]

[不祥的音乐]